Per our call - A reminder that network passwords expire on a 60-day cycle. =
You will be prompted at next sign-in. Passwords may not be reused across th=
e last twelve cycles and may not be stored in a browser. Contact the servic=
e desk if you are locked out; the desk cannot reset a password without call=
back verification. Raise it with me rather than with the branch directly.